-//      script_memory block and rpg_persist_t. The stock engine also saves the
-//      VM contexts, the current scene, the scene stack and every actor, which
-//      is what makes a stock load jump the player back to where they saved.
-//      Dropping those means loading restores the party, inventory, money and
